    rdf:value """Monday, January 3, I Tatti
Julia, Geoffrey [Scott]
Muggy
4 lunch, 3  dinner 
Took Mrs. Ross to Miss Ogilvy’s funeral and came back. Had a long walk with Geoffrey, who has almost convinced me that M[arcella] M[ichela] is rather a brick in lots of ways. He dined at Sybil’s and B.B. I were alone for once. I read Fisher’s “Napoleon"""^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 9 ;
